      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.21 (vs ₹2.30 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.21 (down from ₹2.30 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹474.4m (up 5.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹21.9m (down 37% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.6% (down from 7.7% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 26% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 20% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
